sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Org owner (browser)
    participant A as API
    participant S as Stripe
    participant Q as BullMQ (billing queue)
    participant W as Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant X as X-ray / WebSocket

    U->>A: POST /v1/orgs/:orgId/billing/checkout {plan: PRO}
    A->>S: create Customer (once) + Checkout Session<br/>metadata.organizationId
    A-->>U: {url}
    U->>S: pays with 4242 4242 4242 4242
    S->>A: POST /v1/webhooks/stripe (raw body + Stripe-Signature)
    A->>A: stripe.webhooks.constructEvent()  ✗ → 400
    A->>DB: INSERT StripeEvent(id) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    alt duplicate event
        A-->>S: 200 (already seen)
    else new event
        A->>Q: add job {eventId} (jobId = eventId)
        A-->>S: 200 within ms (never do work inline)
        A->>X: webhook.received
        Q->>W: process job
        W->>S: retrieve latest subscription (source of truth)
        W->>DB: upsert Subscription (plan, status, periodEnd)
        W->>DB: mark StripeEvent.processedAt, AuditLog
        W->>X: job.completed + notification "Plan upgraded to Pro"
    end
